title: Where
---
Helenor: I don't have a so called place
Are you fine?
Helenor: Yes, yes, I never had a place, my species was one of the first to really get into the space business.
Helenor: We are travelling for so long that we forgot where we came from
Helenor: I do consider you earthlings strange for being so sacred with your roots
<<quemFala 0>>

